<title>USA: American Standard jumps as trade opens.</title>
<headline>American Standard jumps as trade opens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of American Standard Cos rose sharply as trading opened after the company disclosed it rejected a merger proposal from Tyco International Ltd.</p>
<p>American Standard rose 4-1/2 to 44-1/2.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, shares of Tyco were down 1/2 at 54-1/8.</p>
<p>--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723</p>
</text>
